# my-data-agent

Bun + TypeScript + LangGraph + OpenAI SDK ReAct Agent framework.

## Build & Check

```bash
bun install
bun run start
bun run typecheck
```

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── index.ts              # Test entry
└── agent/
    ├── index.ts           # Exports: createAgent + all types
    ├── createAgent.ts     # Factory: registry → graph → compile
    ├── graph.ts           # StateGraph: START → llmNode ⇄ toolNode → END
    ├── state.ts           # Annotation.Root
    ├── llmNode.ts         # OpenAI call → AIMessage
    ├── toolNode.ts        # Execute tools → ToolMessage
    ├── shouldContinue.ts  # Route decision
    ├── registry.ts        # Tool registry
    └── types.ts           # Shared types
```

## Key Rules

- **zod v3** only (zod-to-json-schema incompatible with v4)
- **Env vars**: `MODEL_NAME`, `MODEL_API_KEY`, `MODEL_API_URL`
- **Agent module details**: see `.cursor/rules/agent-framework.mdc` for full API reference and design patterns